{"id":"wb-8-169","name":"北张庄墓群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北张庄墓群","text":"北张庄墓群位于河北省邯郸市邯山区北张庄镇北张庄、大隐豹、西孙庄、陈家岗等村附近，属于战汉时期的官宦大臣墓。2019年10月，被中华人民共和国国务院列为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E5%BC%A0%E5%BA%84%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":86856696,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856696","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}